== gale_intro ==
Gale: What's up?
    + [Ask what are you doing here]
        -> whats_up
    + [Make fun of him]
        -> ferret_inquiry
        
== whats_up ==
Liora: What are you doing sitting around here?
Gale: Just waiting for your mom to call me in. She usually uses both me and Hecuba's magical energy to make her potions more powerful. We are her familiars after all.
Liora: Oh, I see.
-> END

== ferret_inquiry ==
Liora: You're just a little talking ferret, aren't you?
Gale: RUDE!! I'm a Polecat!
Liora: Sorry, sorry.
-> END